    "projectDetails": "Project Details",
    "projectDetailsContent": "Dheewarayo is a smart mobile application designed to empower local fishing communities by providing weather alerts, AI-driven fishing hotspot predictions, and species identification capabilities. It aims to make fishing safer and more sustainable.",
    "developerDetails": "Developer Details",
    "developerDetailsContent": "Developed by Meshan Miranda\nUndergraduate - Computer Science\nPassionate about AI and community-driven tech solutions.",
    "universityDetails": "University Details",
    "universityDetailsContent": "BSc (Hons) in Computer Science\nUniversity of Bedfordshire\nSLIIT City Uni",
    "researchDetails": "Research Details",
    "researchDetailsContent": "This application is a part of a final year research project focusing on applying Artificial Intelligence and Machine Learning techniques to optimize traditional fishing practices while strictly adhering to marine sustainability policies.",
    "faq1Question": "What is Dheewarayo app?",
    "faq1Answer": "It's a smart mobile application providing weather alerts, AI fishing hotspots, and species identification for local fishing communities.",
    "faq2Question": "How does the AI Fishing Prediction work?",
    "faq2Answer": "Our AI uses real-time weather, oceanographic data (PFZ), and tide to predict the best fishing locations and times.",
    "faq3Question": "How does the Weather Prediction work?",
    "faq3Answer": "Accurate weather predictions are generated by analyzing international weather data and reports.",
    "faq4Question": "What does the \"Safe to Sail\" status mean?",
    "faq4Answer": "It means the current and predicted weather conditions (wind, waves) are favorable and safe for your small vessel. Always use personal judgment.",
    "faq5Question": "How can I set my fishing area and boat type?",
    "faq5Answer": "Go to Settings -> Fisherman Settings. You can choose your preferred fishing days, times, boat type, and fishing area.",
    "faq6Question": "How do I change the app language?",
    "faq6Answer": "Go to Settings -> Language, and select either English or Sinhala.",
    "faq7Question": "Can I share my catches with other fishermen?",
    "faq7Answer": "Yes! You can use the Community tab to add a post, write a caption, and upload an image of your catch or sea conditions.",
    "faq8Question": "How do I get notifications for bad weather?",
    "faq8Answer": "The app automatically sends critical alerts like \"High Wind Warning\" to keep you safe. Make sure notifications are enabled in your phone settings.",
    "faq9Question": "What is the 10-Hour Marine Forecast?",
    "faq9Answer": "It provides a detailed hour-by-hour prediction of weather, wind, and sea conditions for the next 10 hours so you can plan your daily trip safely.",
    "faq10Question": "How can I delete a post I made in the community?",
    "faq10Answer": "Go to your post in the Community Feed, tap the options menu (three dots), and select \"Delete\".",
